WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.270
Amritsar.

2
00:00:01.320 --> 00:00:04.650
A golden building sits lower
than the city around it,

3
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:07.140
with four doors open to all.

4
00:00:07.190 --> 00:00:12.170
Facing it stands the Akal Takht,
a seat of worldly authority.

5
00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:17.610
Then, in 1708, Guru Gobind Singh
ended the line of human Gurus.

6
00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:22.880
So who has authority among Sikhs,
now there is no living human Guru?

7
00:00:22.930 --> 00:00:26.470
In this mission, you'll trace
how the Gurus built a community,

8
00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:29.430
from Guru Nanak to the
building of Amritsar.

9
00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:33.600
Then you'll ask whether an online
gathering can be a true sangat,

10
00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:35.730
a true holy company.

11
00:00:35.780 --> 00:00:39.580
Your mission: find out who
has authority among Sikhs,

12
00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:41.870
now there is no living human Guru.
